sentences.text:
It is directed that the petitioner shall be released on bail, in the event of arrest in crime No.937/2023 of Mannar police Station subject to the following conditions:-
(i) Petitioner/ 2nd accused shall execute bond for a sum of Rs.50,000/- (Rupees fifty thousand only) with two solvent sureties each for the like sum to the satisfaction of the arresting officer;
(ii) Petitioner shall appear before the investigating officer in Crime No.937/2023 of Mannar Police station as and when summoned to do so;
(iii) The petitioner shall not attempt to contact the de facto complainant or to interfere with the investigation or to influence or intimidate any witness in Crime No.
Ajeesh S vs State Of Kerala on 16 November, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/60827149/
2 937/2023 of Mannar police station;

